#. type: Title #
#: docs/sap/overview.md:1 docs/sap/overview.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "SAP Overview"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "**SAP** (Satellite Application Protocol, version `SAP/1.0`) is the WebSocket JSON protocol between the FreeAnima **Hub** (`anima service`) and **Satellite** processes. Satellites are standalone apps (Parlor, pair-programming Studio) that expose their own HTTP UI while delegating agent runtime to the Hub.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:10
msgid ""
"Schemas and client SDK live in [`packages/sap-contract/`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/). Hub server implementation: [`platform/src/sap/`](../../platform/"
"src/sap/)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/overview.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design goals"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:17
msgid ""
"**One Hub WS per instance**: each satellite instance opens exactly one `/sap/"
"v1` connection to the Hub (multiplex sessions, streams, tools)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:17
msgid ""
"**Origin isolation**: browsers load Satellite HTTP UI; pair-programming uses "
"a local SAP relay (`/sap/relay/v1`) instead of REST hub-api."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:17
msgid ""
"**Local execution**: pair-programming workspace, terminal PTY, and "
"registered tools run on the Satellite process."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:17
msgid ""
"**Shared contract**: both sides import `@freeanima/sap-contract` for "
"envelopes, RPC types, `runSapTransport`, `createSapBrowserClient`, and "
"`createSapRelayBrowserClient`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/overview.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Topology"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/overview.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart LR\n"
"  subgraph parlor [Parlor satellite]\n"
"    B1[Browser] -->|SAP WS| Hub\n"
"    P1[Static HTTP] -.-> B1\n"
"  end\n"
"  subgraph ppy [Pair-programming satellite]\n"
"    B2[Browser] -->|relay WS| Relay[\"/sap/relay/v1\"]\n"
"    Relay --> Proc[Process SAP client]\n"
"    Proc -->|唯一 SAP WS| Hub\n"
"    B2 --> Local[Local FS + PTY]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Hub --> Runtime[AgentRuntime]\n"
"  subgraph hubWebUI [Hub WebUI]\n"
"    Chamber[Chamber admin]\n"
"  end\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Role      | Default                 | Responsibility                                   |\n"
"| --------- | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Hub       | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | Agent runtime, SAP WebSocket server at `/sap/v1` |\n"
"| Parlor    | `http://127.0.0.1:4174` | Chat UI; browser-direct SAP (Type A)             |\n"
"| Pair-prog | `http://127.0.0.1:4173` | Studio UI; process gateway + relay (Type B)      |\n"
"| Chamber   | Hub `/chamber/*`        | Memory, config, tools, satellite status          |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:46
msgid ""
"See also: [architecture WebUI section](../concepts/architecture.md#webui)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/overview.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "End-to-end happy path"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/overview.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Sat as Satellite process\n"
"  participant Hub as Hub\n"
"  participant Agent as AgentRuntime\n"
"\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: connect\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: connected\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.register\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res ok\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req session.create\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res session_id\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req message.send\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: res stream_id\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.accepted\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.token\n"
"  Agent->>Hub: invoke sap tool\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt tool.call\n"
"  Sat->>Hub: req tool.result\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.tool_result\n"
"  Hub-->>Sat: evt stream.done\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:78
msgid "Satellite process opens `ws://{hub}/sap/v1` and sends `connect`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:78
msgid ""
"Hub replies `connected` and registers the instance in `SatelliteManager`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:78
msgid "Satellite registers local tools via `tool.register`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:78
msgid ""
"UI traffic (Type B) goes Browser → `/sap/relay/v1` → same process SAP client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:78
msgid ""
"`message.send` returns a `stream_id`; Hub pushes `stream.*` events (fan-out "
"on relay)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: docs/sap/overview.md:78
msgid ""
"When the agent calls a Satellite tool, Hub sends `tool.call`; Satellite "
"replies with `tool.result` or `tool.error`."
msgstr ""

